gotten to --

00:06:59.585 --> 00:07:02.488
Like, reading that question,
I understand it as a parent,

00:07:02.488 --> 00:07:05.257
but also it's kind of hilarious
that you're acting like

00:07:05.257 --> 00:07:07.860
this 5-year-old girl
can beat the crap out of you.

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:10.429
Okay? You're the parent.
She's the kid.

00:07:10.429 --> 00:07:12.631
You tell the kid
that they have to sit there

00:07:12.631 --> 00:07:14.500
until they finish
their vegetables.

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:17.770
And dessert should be something
that they occasionally have.

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:22.274
So you have to
undo what you did,

00:07:22.274 --> 00:07:25.010
which was you let this kid
get away with murder.

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:27.379
The fact that that kid is
throwing vegetables on the floor

00:07:27.379 --> 00:07:31.083
