00:07:34.152 --> 00:07:35.721
It doesn't. All right?

00:07:35.721 --> 00:07:39.358
It's not paying any rent.
It has no -- [ Laughs ]

00:07:39.358 --> 00:07:40.926
It has no bargaining chips.

00:07:40.926 --> 00:07:44.062
-The kid's not unboxing toys
or anything. Nothing.

00:07:44.062 --> 00:07:45.998
-Yes. Yes.
It's not "Ryan's World."

00:07:45.998 --> 00:07:48.000
Okay? Ryan can throw
his vegetables.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:50.803
My daughter loves that show.

00:07:50.803 --> 00:07:53.338
It's one of the few times
