of that show. I'm sorry."

00:08:06.052 --> 00:08:08.453
All right? I can watch
Bugs Bunny all day long,

00:08:08.453 --> 00:08:12.091
I can watch "Sesame Street."
There's jokes in it for me, too.

00:08:12.091 --> 00:08:14.193
All right?
I actually watch "Ryan's World,"

00:08:14.193 --> 00:08:16.262
